            </note>
            <note corresp="#d486-f2" n="2" xml:id="d486-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 58793 to Beirut and other missions, October 24, set forth U.S. military
                    supply policy for the Middle East. (Ibid., DEF 19–8 US–NEAR E)</p>
            </note>
